 "description": "Crypto market read in one call: a live Coinbase spot quote and live Polymarket probabilities on the same subject, analysed together in a written summary. Input: optional product_id, query, question and limit. Market data and implied probabilities only, not investment advice. $5.00 per call. Returns: spot{}, prediction_markets[], analysis, disclaimer.",
